# drive-a/ and drive-b/ hold the checked-in starter binaries (HELLO.COM,
# BREAKOUT.COM). Don't commit other third-party CP/M software (Zork,
# Turbo Pascal etc.) added there: add its name here or use `git add -f`
# deliberately.
!/drive-a/*.COM
!/drive-b/*.COM

# kc-z80-comp-emu build outputs
